e the two of them the «Soberano al Mérito» together.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Other directions","type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"In 1985 she recorded with ","type":"text"},{"type":"artistReference","attrs":{"artistId":"99537a98-fb19-4487-814d-c60d91c4d10b","displayText":"Luis \"Terror\" Días","occurrenceId":"33d360df-40fc-4031-83db-0d7f92076fc8"}},{"text":" and «Transporte Urbano»; the sessions stayed on the shelf until 2000, when they were issued as «Vickiana: las sesiones del 1985». Her «Mi amor sin ti» was used in the 1991 Hollywood film «One Good Cop». She represented the country again at the «Festival OTI» of 1990, in Las Vegas, with «Yo», by ","type":"text"},{"type":"artistReference","attrs":{"artistId":"25a420d1-7a98-4fd2-93c8-38d3ed2d2dc1","displayText":"José Antonio Rodríguez","occurrenceId":"a947ba2e-0a13-4208-a99b-c0e19245aec1"}},{"text":". The albums continued through «Vickiana II» (1990), «Más que amor» (1991), «Vickiana III» (1994), «Amargada» (1995), «Infiel» (1998) and «En calor» (2000), and the duets crossed genres: «Te perdono», a bachata with ","type":"text"},{"type":"artistReference","attrs":{"artistId":"5ceceef0-765d-4e01-8017-85422a263357","displayText":"Luis Segura","occurrenceId":"2f5b7f20-3b6a-4adc-8265-d721c7de333f"}},{"text":"; «Aún vivo para el amor» with ","type":"text"},{"type":"artistReference","attrs":{"artistId":"1131dfe6-f404-44b4-8d0d-f8120dc6f71a","displayText":"Fernando Casado","occurrenceId":"0180dfe8-ea0f-4644-a73d-47d1010b4ab7"}},{"text":"; and «Canto paz y un mundo nuevo», alongside ","type":"text"},{"type":"artistReference","attrs":{"artistId":"8e29188a-215b-4c6c-b34a-45b381765e46","displayText":"Xiomara Fortuna","occurrenceId":"42980639-b146-45b7-a1f4-2e6955bfe0be"}},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"artistReference","attrs":{"artistId":"2cc97ca9-126d-48c5-922f-e9d5c8b0360d","displayText":"Sonia Silvestre","occurrenceId":"20e5880e-98f4-485